codex
The failure reproduces in `lean --version`, while `lake --version` succeeds; that isolates it to Lean’s executable-path lookup, not the project configuration. The process sees a namespace-local PID that is absent from the mounted `/proc`, so I’m testing the smallest environment-level correction before touching proof code.
